# このファイルの除外ルールは、Chrome/ と Safari/ を含む
# リポジトリ内のすべてのサブディレクトリへ再帰的に適用します。

# macOS
**/.DS_Store
**/.AppleDouble
**/.LSOverride
**/._*

# Editors and local workspace settings
**/.idea/
**/.vscode/
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~

# Codex and agent-local settings
**/.codex/
**/.agents/
**/AGENTS.local.md

# Environment variables and local configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
!**/.env.template
**/*.local

# Credentials, keys, and certificates
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.jks
**/*.keystore
**/*.cer
**/*.crt
**/*.der
**/*.mobileprovision
**/credentials.json
**/secrets.json

# Logs, temporary files, and caches
**/*.log
**/logs/
**/tmp/
**/temp/
**/.cache/
**/.npm-cache/
**/.parcel-cache/
**/.eslintcache

# JavaScript dependencies and build output
**/node_modules/
**/dist/
**/build/
**/coverage/
**/.nyc_output/

# Package-manager debug logs
**/npm-debug.log*
**/yarn-debug.log*
**/yarn-error.log*
**/pnpm-debug.log*

# Browser extension packages and signing artifacts
**/*.crx
**/*.xpi
**/*.zip
**/web-ext-artifacts/

# Local browser profiles and test data
**/browser-profile/
**/browser-profiles/
**/chrome-profile/
**/safari-profile/
**/user-data/

# Safari and Xcode generated files
**/DerivedData/
**/.build/
**/xcuserdata/
**/*.xcuserstate
**/*.xccheckout
**/*.xcscmblueprint

# Test artifacts
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/
**/blob-report/
